==German==

===Etymology===
From {{compound|de|Kümmel|t1=caraway|Blättchen|t2=little card}}. The first element is actually a [[folk etymology]], and is an alteration of {{der|de|he|גִּימֶל|tr=gímel||the third letter of the Hebrew alphabet}}.

